+ ‘‘Yaṃ kiñcahaṃ cakkhunā passissāmi \[passāmi (ka.)\], sabbampi tāhaṃ
  abhisaddaheyyaṃ; Disvāva taṃ nopi ce saddaheyyaṃ, kareyyāsi \[karohi
  (katthaci)\] me yakkha niyassakamma''nti.

+ ‘‘Saccappaṭiññā tava mesā hotu, sutvāna dhammaṃ labha suppasādaṃ;
