+ ‘‘Te aññamaññaṃ akarimha sakkhiṃ, ayañca sūlato \[sūlāvuto (sī.
  syā.)\] lahuṃ pamutto; Sakkacca dhammāni samācaranto, mucceyya so
  nirayā ca tamhā; Kammaṃ siyā aññatra vedanīyaṃ.

+ ‘‘Kappitakañca upasaṅkamitvā, teneva \[tena (syā. ka.)\] saha
  saṃvibhajitvā kāle; Sayaṃ mukhenūpanisajja puccha, so te akkhissati
