#block[
#set enum(numbering: "1.", start: 5)
+ Ucchupetavatthu

+ ‘‘Idaṃ mama ucchuvanaṃ mahantaṃ, nibbattati puññaphalaṃ anappakaṃ; Taṃ
  dāni me na \[na dāni me taṃ (sī. ka.)\] paribhogameti, ācikkha bhante
  kissa ayaṃ vipāko.

+ ‘‘Haññāmi \[vihaññāmi (ka.)\] khajjāmi ca vāyamāmi, parisakkāmi
  paribhuñjituṃ kiñci; Svāhaṃ chinnathāmo kapaṇo lālapāmi, kissa
  \[kissassa (sī.), kissassu (?)\] kammassa ayaṃ vipāko.

+ ‘‘Vighāto cāhaṃ paripatāmi chamāyaṃ, parivattāmi vāricarova ghamme;
  Rudato ca me \[dūrato ca me (syā. ka.)\] assukā niggalanti, ācikkha
  bhante kissa ayaṃ vipāko.

+ ‘‘Chāto kilanto ca pipāsito ca, santassito sātasukhaṃ na vinde;
