+ ‘‘So ca taṃ abhaṇantaṃ ayāci, ‘dehayya ucchu'nti ca taṃ avoca; Tassa
  tuvaṃ piṭṭhito ucchuṃ adāsi, tassetaṃ kammassa ayaṃ vipāko.

+ ‘‘Iṅgha tvaṃ gantvāna piṭṭhito gaṇheyyāsi \[iṅgha tvaṃ piṭṭhito gaṇha
  ucchuṃ (sī.)\], gahetvāna taṃ khādassu yāvadatthaṃ; Teneva tvaṃ
  attamano bhavissasi, haṭṭho cudaggo ca pamodito cā''ti.

+ Gantvāna so piṭṭhito aggahesi, gahetvāna taṃ khādi yāvadatthaṃ; Teneva
